From 01bc7f6d9eab48412bb927df8565f1e0e142135d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:21:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] server: per-request inference tracing for the visualizer

[visualizer-trace] A request with a "trace" object gets __trace events on
its response chunks: decode.layer/op/residual/attn/kv.write/moe from the
scheduler eval callback (installed only for traced batches), real
prefill.batch/prefill.layer per ubatch, prefill.done, decode.sample and
decode.sample.stage per sampler. Traced requests run in a batch of their
own. Step mode blocks between layers or sampler stages until
POST /trace/ack.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
